    {"t":0,"text":"Kneel and sit back into child’s pose: hips toward your heels, arms long in front, forehead toward the floor."},
    {"t":3,"text":"Walk both hands over to the left until you feel a stretch along the right side of your back."},
    {"t":6,"text":"Breathe deeply into your right back ribs, 5 to 8 breaths. Let them widen on each breath in."},
